---
const year = new Date().getFullYear();
---

<footer class="site-footer">
  <div class="container footer-inner">
    <div class="footer-brand">
      <span class="footer-logo">🐾 Nature &amp; Chien</span>
      <p>Des informations et des conseils fiables sur la randonnée avec son chien en France.</p>
    </div>

    <nav class="footer-nav" aria-label="Navigation pied de page">
      <div class="footer-col">
        <h3>Explorer</h3>
        <ul>
          <li><a href="/avant-de-partir">Avant de partir</a></li>
          <li><a href="/sante-bien-etre">Santé &amp; bien-être</a></li>
          <li><a href="/equipement">Équipement</a></li>
        </ul>
      </div>
      <div class="footer-col">
        <h3>Le site</h3>
        <ul>
          <li><a href="/a-propos">À propos</a></li>
          <li><a href="/mentions-legales">Mentions légales</a></li>
          <li><a href="/politique-confidentialite">Confidentialité</a></li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </nav>
  </div>

  <div class="footer-bottom">
    <div class="container">
      <p>© {year} Nature &amp; Chien · Certains liens peuvent être affiliés — <a href="/mentions-legales#affiliation">en savoir plus</a>.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</footer>

<style>
.site-footer {
  background: #1a2e23;
  color: #c5d9cc;
  margin-top: 4rem;
}
.footer-inner {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: 1fr auto;
  gap: 3rem;
  padding: 3rem 1.25rem 2rem;
}
.footer-brand p { font-size: 0.92rem; color: #8dab97; max-width: 28ch; margin-top: 0.6rem; }
.footer-logo { font-family: var(--font-serif); font-weight: 700; font-size: 1.1rem; color: white; }

.footer-nav { display: flex; gap: 3rem; }
.footer-col h3 { font-size: 0.8rem; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.08em; text-transform: uppercase; color: #8dab97; margin-bottom: 0.75rem; }
.footer-col ul { list-style: none; margin: 0; padding: 0; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 0.4rem; }
.footer-col a { color: #c5d9cc; font-size: 0.92rem; text-decoration: none; transition: color 0.15s; }
.footer-col a:hover { color: white; text-decoration: none; }

.footer-bottom {
  border-top: 1px solid #2d4a38;
  padding: 1rem 1.25rem;
  font-size: 0.82rem;
  color: #6b8a77;
}
.footer-bottom a { color: #8dab97; }

@media (max-width: 700px) {
  .footer-inner { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 2rem; padding-bottom: 1.5rem; }
  .footer-nav { flex-direction: column; gap: 1.5rem; }
}
</style>
